<rdf:Description rdf:about="" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">
<dc:creator>Phillip E. / Assistive AI</dc:creator><dc:format>application/pdf</dc:format><dc:title><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default"> WCAG 2.1 and Survey Response Rates | White Paper </rdf:li></rdf:Alt></dc:title><dc:description>Primary subject: Web accessibility standards (WCAG 2.1/2.2) applied to online survey design

Discipline intersections: Survey methodology &amp; research design, Digital accessibility &amp; inclusive design, Public health / organizational research (as context for survey use), Legal compliance (ADA, Section 508, procurement law), UX and human-computer interaction

Target audiences: Survey researchers, UX/accessibility practitioners, compliance officers, nonprofit and government program evaluators, academic IRB staff, health researchers</dc:description></rdf:Description>
